# T78 history part (row I170): a song played to its end counts one play, a song replaced by the user counts one
# skip, LIKE marks the song being played. history_writes is the sentinel that the engine writer ran.
OPEN selecta-test.mod
PLAY
@render_until_end
OPEN selecta-test-mk.mod
PLAY
@render 1024
LIKE
OPEN selecta-test.mod
@library_stats
LIBRARY_SEARCH plays:1
@results
LIBRARY_SEARCH skips:1
@results
LIBRARY_SEARCH liked:yes
@results
